# Fractional durations: three 4/3-beat notes make an exact 4-beat loop
# and stay on the beat after many passes; sevenths likewise. A
# deliberately uneven loop (4.1 beats) phases against a 4-beat track,
# the same way every pass.
open virtual
track 1 60:4/3 62:4/3 64:4/3
track 2:2 72:1/7 73:1/7 74:1/7 75:1/7 76:1/7 77:1/7 78:1/7
play continue
runto 4.01
log
runto 3999.9
logdrop
runto 4001.01
log
close
open virtual
track 1 60:4
track 2:2 72:4.1
play continue
runto 9
log
runto 40
logdrop
runto 42
log
